<title>USA: TRW wins $59 mln Air Force contract.</title>
<headline>TRW wins $59 mln Air Force contract.</headline>
<dateline>REDONDO BEACH, Calif. 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>TRW Inc on Tuesday said the U.S. Air Force has awarded the company a $59.2 million contract to develop and produce a digital processing prototype for a new generation of satellites.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement the 36-month contract is for the Department of Defense's next-generation satellite communications system based on the High Frequency (EHF) Engineering Model.</p>
<p>It is intended to help mitigate schedule, cost and technology development risks for procuring the Advanced EHF Milsatcom System, which is a follow-on to the Department of Defense's Milstar satellite communications system.</p>
</text>
